    "turn_text": "I actually think that you're one of the people in Congress that has been very supportive of nuclear industry as part of a climate change strategy and sometimes I think that's Climate change gets caught up in culture wars in interesting ways, so that people who are skeptical about the climate movement will say, you say this is an emergency, it's going to destroy life on Earth. We've got to sacrifice everything to make it stop, but you won't have a single nuclear power plant, even though it's zero emissions. And that has the effect of making skeptics more skeptical. I think you don't really believe what you're saying, or you would have a different position on",
